SUMMARY:V for Volleyball at Overpeck Park
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nI'm
  Mike and my son is Michael. Join us as we play for fun initially\, then w
 e'll break up into teams. When we make teams\, we'll get a bit competitive
  where you must serve to score! Games will be to 25 or 15 if we have more 
 people playing.\nOutdoor hard court. No kicking\, no using your head.\nWe 
 may be going to Tropical Juice Bar afterwards at 60 River St. in Hackensac
 k or somewhere for food/drinks.\nThere's no fee to play\, maybe bring a ba
 ll. We'll have 2 Mikasa balls & 1 Wilson ball.\nIt's not on 41 Willow Tree
  Road\, Leonia\, NJ.\nThe court is open to the public and if it happens to
  be taken\, we may play with those already playing or we will move to the 
 grass since we have our own Volleyball NET!\nIf it's looking like it'll ra
 in\, I'll make a call on whether to cancel.\nIf you have fun and would lik
 e to play with us at other locations\, join us!\n[Volleyball at Overpeck P
 ark in Leonia at 1pm to 6pm | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/events/11
 46611264224277?acontext=%7B%22event_action_history%22%3A%5B%7B%22mechanism
 %22%3A%22surface%22%2C%22surface%22%3A%22groups_highlight_units%22%7D%5D%2
 C%22ref_notif_type%22%3Anull%7D)\nJoin our group at [V for Volleyball New 
 Jersey | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/groups/1587314685975434)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314285807/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260414T220326Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260414T220326Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
