SUMMARY:Adult Kickball - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nCom
 e join us for two to three hours of adult kickball at a local park.\n\nThe
  event is tentatively scheduled for Columbus Park\, 71 W Franklin St\, Hac
 kensack\, because it has a huge grass field.\n\nWe'll grab a kickball\, so
 me bases and split up into teams to play. Comment below if you have your o
 wn to bring. There are a ton of parking spaces on West Franklin Street.\n\
 n\\*\\*\\* After playing\, we'll likely be heading to Tropical Juice Bar\,
  60 River St.\, Hackensack. Feel free to suggest another spot to hang out.
  \\*\\*\\*\n\nThere's no fee to play and nothing else you need to do besid
 es show up. Come anytime!! All are welcome!!! We're not in a league and ar
 e not here to analyze your form. We're here for people who haven't played 
 in months\, maybe years\, and just want to play again and hang out.\n\nHop
 e you'll join us for our second kickball event. Questions or comments? You
  can message Andy on Meetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609.\nCheck out
  bowling\, soccer\, volleyball\, tennis\, skating or one of our other acti
 vities at: [www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball](https:/
 /www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball)
